			],
			"Message": "docs(Common): Restyle README with condensed sections, component table, and funding badges\n\nCompact the Common crate README by removing the header HTML table, the full directory tree listing, lengthy per-section explanations, and the verbose funding acknowledgements block. Replace with a tighter narrative structure: add an emoji-accented title, an inline Overview paragraph summarizing all core concepts, a new Key Components table linking each service domain to its source path, an Architecture Principles table, and a compact In the Land Project section. Simplify the See Also section into Related Documentation preserving all essential links. Replace the License and Changelog sections with inline references. Move the ActionEffect code example after the architecture principles, keeping the Getting Started guide intact.\n\nThe restyled README is scannable at a glance, surfaces the project structure table, and eliminates redundant whitespace and decorative elements while preserving all technical content.",
